I've clearly been bad at updating this website since I joined _The Assembly_ as a staff reporter covering higher ed in September 2024, so I'm going to take the easy way out and include some of my favorite pieces here. 

I guess I should also note that in those two years I was part of the team that won the 2025 and 2026 Duke University/Green-Rossiter Awards for Distinguished Newspaper Work in Higher Education Reporting from the North Carolina Press Association. The newsletter I coatuhor, _The Quad_, also won the 2026 award for best digital newsletter in the southeast from the Society of Professional Journalists' Green Eyeshade Awards. (You can [sign up at our website](https://www.theassemblync.com/newsletters/higher-education/).) I also added second- and third-place awards in sports enterprise reporting.

